Recommends: podman | docker.io
Suggests: qemu-system-x86, libvirt-clients, virt-viewer, remmina
Description: native GNOME hub for virtual machines and containers
 Rigs starts, stops and monitors local QEMU/KVM virtual machines, Podman and
 Docker containers, Compose projects and libvirt domains. It shows live CPU
 and memory graphs, hot-swaps ISO images, explains failed starts in plain
 language and integrates with GNOME Shell search.
